    # Demo1 3: markers same rowband(2), different colbands(0,4): fills rowband 2 horizontally, plus 6 at intersection with 2's column.
    # So general: for each color: if markers share colband -> vertical fill of that colband (all rows). If share rowband -> horizontal fill of that rowband (all cols).
